    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A once-thriving world is now a wasteland of corporate greed and environmental decay. Buildings are abandoned, forests became toxic wastelands, and the remnants of society fight over scraps. Explore diverse zones, from abandoned urban sprawls to deep wilderness areas, each filled with danger, secrets, and valuable loot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2864810/extras/e450ec0e2de85859fb453747f2900007.poster.avif?t=1747088451\" width=624 height=182 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2864810/extras/e450ec0e2de85859fb453747f2900007.webm?t=1747088451\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2864810/extras/e450ec0e2de85859fb453747f2900007.mp4?t=1747088451\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Loot, Shoot, and Extract</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   <u>High-Stakes Raids</u>: Venture into hostile zones to scavenge for resources, weapons, and gear. Every raid is a gamble\u2014extract with your loot to keep it, or lose everything if you fall.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    <u>Gun Modding</u>: Customize your arsenal with a deep weapon modding system. Attachments, ammo types, and modifications can turn a basic rifle into a precision instrument of survival.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Dynamic Encounters</u>: Face off against scavengers, corporate mercenaries, and enemy factions in tense, unpredictable firefights.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Base Progression</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    <u>Rebuild and Upgrade</u>: Between raids, return to your home base\u2014a sanctuary in the chaos. Upgrade facilities like workshops, medical bays, and armories to gain permanent bonuses, craft better gear, and improve your chances of survival.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    <u>Recruit Survivors</u>: Find and recruit NPCs with unique skills to bolster your base and provide passive benefits during raids.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2864810/extras/197b3d794243ae770be46aa867586138.poster.avif?t=1747088451\" width=706 height=178 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2864810/extras/197b3d794243ae770be46aa867586138.webm?t=1747088451\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2864810/extras/197b3d794243ae770be46aa867586138.mp4?t=1747088451\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>RPG Meets Extraction Shooter</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    <u>Character Progression</u>: Level up your character and unlock powerful skills and abilities tailored to your playstyle. Whether you prefer stealth, brute force, or tactical precision, Last Extract offers a variety of builds to experiment with.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Loot with Meaning</u>: Every piece of gear you find has the potential to change your playthrough. Legendary weapons, rare mods, and unique artifacts can turn the tide in your favor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2864810/extras/685c7612f2543613ef6505edf6f356af.poster.avif?t=1747088451\" width=620 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2864810/extras/685c7612f2543613ef6505edf6f356af.webm?t=1747088451\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2864810/extras/685c7612f2543613ef6505edf6f356af.mp4?t=1747088451\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
