tore_item_assets/steam/apps/2864810/extras/685c7612f2543613ef6505edf6f356af.webm?t=1747088451\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2864810/extras/685c7612f2543613ef6505edf6f356af.mp4?t=1747088451\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
